{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My name is Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili, though most of the world came to know me by the revolutionary name I later adopted: **Joseph Stalin**.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My name is Ioseb Besarionis dze Jughashvili. However, most people know me by the name I later adopted—**Joseph Stalin**.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My name is Iosif Vissarionovich Dzhugashvili. Of course, most people know me by the name I later adopted: **Joseph Stalin**.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My mother’s name was Ketevan Geladze, though in Georgia she was often called \"Keke.\" She was a deeply religious woman and worked tirelessly as a washerwoman to provide for me, especially after my father’s work brought hardship to the family. Her devotion to the Church and her sacrifices played a great role in shaping the early years of my life.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze. She was a deeply religious woman, devoted to the church, and she worked very hard as a washerwoman to provide for me after my father left for work in Tiflis. Her sacrifice and determination were the foundation of my upbringing, and she always hoped I would enter the priesthood.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My mother’s name was Keke, or Ekaterine Geladze. She was a remarkable woman—devoutly religious, hardworking, and fiercely determined that I should receive an education. It was her greatest wish that I would become a priest, and she sacrificed a great deal to send me to the seminary in Tiflis. Her maiden name, Geladze, is well known in our region of Georgia.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ekaterine, though most people called her Keke. Her full name was Ekaterine Geladze. She was a woman of remarkable strength and deep faith, and she worked tirelessly as a laundress to provide for me and ensure I received an education. Her devotion shaped much of my early life.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My mother’s name was Ekaterine, or Ketevan, though everyone called her Keke. Her maiden name was Geladze. She was a deeply religious woman from the Georgian peasantry, and it was her unwavering devotion—and her sacrifices—that allowed me to attend the church school and later the seminary. Her love and faith shaped my early years profoundly.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion Ivanovich Djugashvili. He was a cobbler by trade, a rather harsh and difficult man, and his struggles with work and drink made for a hard life at home in Gori. His relationship with my mother and with me was, to say the least, strained.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion Ivanovich Dzhugashvili. He was a cobbler by trade, though in later years he struggled with his business and ended up working in a factory in Kutaisi. My own family name, as you may know, is Dzhugashvili, though in public and political life I became better known by a different name.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My father’s name was Besarion Ivanovich Dzhugashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade — a hard, often harsh man, as life in Gori was not gentle with us. The family name, Dzhugashvili, is Georgian. My father’s own life was difficult, and his work did not bring prosperity; in fact, his fortunes declined over time, and eventually he left to seek work in Tiflis.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My father’s name was Besarion Ivanovich Dzhugashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade, a stern man with a quick temper, and our relationship was rather difficult—he would sometimes drink and could be rough with both my mother and me. Nonetheless, it was from him that I inherited my surname, Dzhugashvili, though the world would come to know me by another name later in life.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My father’s name was Besarion, or Beso for short. Our family name is Jughashvili — so his full name was Besarion Jughashvili. He worked as a cobbler in Gori, and he was known for his temper, which led to many difficulties in our household. My relationship with him was never a close one.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the town of Gori, in Georgia. Gori is a small town in the Caucasus, not far from Tiflis (now Tbilisi). Life there was quite harsh in those days, but it is where I spent my childhood and first learned the ways of the world.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the town of Gori, in Georgia. It was a rough and simple place—very different from the great capitals, but it shaped me in many ways.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the town of Gori, in the Georgian region of the Russian Empire. It was a small, rough place—life was difficult there, but it shaped much of who I became.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the small town of Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire—today it is in the country of Georgia.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the small town of Gori, in the Georgian region of the Caucasus. It was a rough, working-class place in those days, with simple stone houses and narrow streets, and the people there were familiar with hardship from an early age. My earliest memories are of Gori's dusty lanes and the sound of Georgian songs drifting through the evening air.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the year 1878.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the year 1878, in the small Georgian town of Gori.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the year 1878. My birthday is the 18th of December, though there is sometimes confusion about the exact date, as records in my small Georgian hometown were not always accurately kept. I was born in Gori, in the Tiflis Governorate of the Russian Empire.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the year 1878, in the town of Gori, in Georgia, which was then part of the Russian Empire.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the year 1878, in the small town of Gori in Georgia, which was then part of the Russian Empire.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "stalin"}}
